          "type": "text",
          "text": "Maintenance team considered a narrow installation area while preparing a replacement design for the river survey buoy. The buoy houses sensors above a sealed battery compartment. A later inspection will compare the finished dimensions with this record. A cone of radius 5 cm and slant height 13 cm is joined base-to-base to a hemisphere of radius 5 cm. Find the external surface area in cm², correct to 1 decimal place."
        }
      ],
